    "enUS": {
      "description": "I'll mix and mix till we have a mash\nFor this will be our own private stash\nA still must be fashioned of metal strong\nBring me some Truesilver so I can finish this song.",
      "dialogue": {
        "005f33d7dcdf4336a2e0": "An encore for you?  Well sure friend!$b$bI'll mix and mix till we have a mash$bFor this will be our own private stash$bA still must be fashioned of metal strong$bBring me some Truesilver so I can finish this song.",
        "331e8ed5b2df34a2418c": "I'll mix and mix till we have a mash$bFor this will be our own private stash$bA still must be fashioned of metal strong$bBring me some Truesilver so I can finish this song.",
        "a6031b3295bdbfbdf8b6": "Hiccup! Ho ho!"
      },
